The first full gate run is still computing, principally because G7 deliberately verifies a doubled 192-dimensional dense instance and G4 performs 200,000 structure-aware guesses. The module has compiled cleanly; I’m waiting for measured results rather than estimating them, and I’ll optimize the test path if this run shows avoidable cost.
