+
+| arm | completed attempts | solved | result |
+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| bare | 0 | 0 | four HTTP 403 total-limit errors; no hardness verdict |
+| structural hint | 0 | 0 | four HTTP 403 total-limit errors; diagnostic incomplete |
+| placebo hint | 0 | 0 | four HTTP 403 total-limit errors; diagnostic incomplete |
+
+Because no arm has a completed attempt, `hinted − placebo` is recorded as
